      "markdown": "## 语文园地七\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"imgs/img_in_image_box_881_2408_1465_2979.jpg\" alt=\"Image\" width=\"3%\" /></div>\n\n\n## 日积月累 RIJI YUELEI\n\n1. 把字和读音连一连。\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"imgs/img_in_image_box_1121_3474_2059_4239.jpg\" alt=\"Image\" width=\"5%\" /></div>\n\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"imgs/img_in_image_box_3337_3626_4689_4347.jpg\" alt=\"Image\" width=\"8%\" /></div>\n\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"imgs/img_in_image_box_1123_4344_2061_5133.jpg\" alt=\"Image\" width=\"5%\" /></div>\n\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"imgs/img_in_image_box_3343_4450_4716_5172.jpg\" alt=\"Image\" width=\"8%\" /></div>\n\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"imgs/img_in_image_box_1118_5221_2062_6018.jpg\" alt=\"Image\" width=\"5%\" /></div>\n\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"imgs/img_in_image_box_3339_5282_4893_6007.jpg\" alt=\"Image\" width=\"9%\" /></div>\n\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"imgs/img_in_image_box_1123_6110_2063_6898.jpg\" alt=\"Image\" width=\"5%\" /></div>\n\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"imgs/img_in_image_box_3349_6113_4625_6818.jpg\" alt=\"Image\" width=\"7%\" /></div>\n\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"imgs/img_in_image_box_1124_7004_2074_7772.jpg\" alt=\"Image\" width=\"5%\" /></div>\n\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"imgs/img_in_image_box_3351_6940_4696_7649.jpg\" alt=\"Image\" width=\"8%\" /></div>\n\n\n2. 把下面的词语补充完整, 再完成练习。\n\n鹅( )大雪 ( )闪雷鸣\n\n( )开雾散 ( )天雪地\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"imgs/img_in_image_box_1446_9442_5160_10655.jpg\" alt=\"Image\" width=\"22%\" /></div>\n\n\n( )雨交加 寒( )刺骨\n\n3. 认真区分,选字填空。\n\n\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"imgs/img_in_image_box_7074_1856_8079_2491.jpg\" alt=\"Image\" width=\"6%\" /></div>\n\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"imgs/img_in_image_box_8735_1854_9742_2492.jpg\" alt=\"Image\" width=\"6%\" /></div>\n\n\n(1)五颜六色的( )球飞上了天空。\n\n(2)夏天,孩子们非常喜欢喝( )水。\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"imgs/img_in_image_box_7086_3371_8072_4006.jpg\" alt=\"Image\" width=\"5%\" /></div>\n\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"imgs/img_in_image_box_8742_3371_9730_4001.jpg\" alt=\"Image\" width=\"5%\" /></div>\n\n\n(3)老师( )领孩子们去海边。\n\n(4) 他( )着一副眼镜,看起来很斯文。\n\n4. 用部首查字法查字典,并完成练习。\n\n\n<table border=1 style='margin: auto; word-wrap: break-word;'><tr><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>要查的字</td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>部首</td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>部首页码</td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>除去部首有几画</td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>字的页码</td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>读音</td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>组词</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>丹</td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'></td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'></td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'></td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'></td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'></td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'></td></tr><tr><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>久</td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'></td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'></td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'></td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'></td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'></td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'></td></tr><tr><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>由</td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'></td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'></td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'></td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'></td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'></td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'></td></tr></table>\n\n5. 你能仿照例子, 把下面的句子写得更有趣吗?\n\n例:仰望天空,星星在闪烁。\n\n仰望天空,星星在眨眼睛。\n\n\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"imgs/img_in_image_box_7467_10269_9321_11510.jpg\" alt=\"Image\" width=\"11%\" /></div>\n\n\n(1)一阵风吹过,荷叶在摇摆。\n\n(2)春风吹来,杏花开了。\n\n三九四九，\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"imgs/img_in_image_box_11075_5400_11541_5893.jpg\" alt=\"Image\" width=\"2%\" /></div>\n\n\n## 亲子阅读 QINZI YUEDU\n\n名著推荐:《小巴掌童话百篇》\n\n推荐理由:本书中的童话童趣盎然,语言优美。故事篇幅短小,却非常生动,富有内涵哲理,用童话的方式教育、引导、启迪我们,让\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"imgs/img_in_image_box_14312_6390_15647_8316.jpg\" alt=\"Image\" width=\"8%\" /></div>\n\n\n我们在感受快乐的同时,学会自我思考。小巴掌童话既是给我们的精神食粮,更是一场心理的馈赠。我们快来一起读一读吧!",
